WEBVTT

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.377
Can you imagine that?

00:15:30.401 --> 00:15:31.904
Can you imagine saying that?

00:15:33.128 --> 00:15:34.544
Can you go there?

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.435
What do you think they're feeling?

00:15:47.723 --> 00:15:49.128
You see, that's empathy.

00:15:49.882 --> 00:15:51.326
It's also understanding.

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:52.978
[understand]

00:15:53.002 --> 00:15:54.310
Now, you might ask,

00:15:54.334 --> 00:15:57.601
"OK, Sam, so why do you
do this sort of thing?

00:15:57.625 --> 00:15:59.985
Why would you use
this example of all examples?"